# Filament 3 patterns (RadarLeb-specific)

The admin panel at `/admin` is built with Filament 3. Filament uses Livewire
under the hood — never try to render Inertia/Vue inside Filament. Read
`docs/architecture.md` for the cohabitation rules.

## Generating new resources

Always use the artisan generator. Never hand-create the scaffolding.

```bash
php artisan make:filament-resource GameRule
# Generates:
#   app/Filament/Resources/GameRuleResource.php
#   app/Filament/Resources/GameRuleResource/Pages/CreateGameRule.php
#   app/Filament/Resources/GameRuleResource/Pages/EditGameRule.php
#   app/Filament/Resources/GameRuleResource/Pages/ListGameRules.php
```

Add `--view` if you need a read-only ViewPage. Add `--simple` for a single-
form-on-a-modal flow.

## Where things live

```
app/Filament/
├── Pages/                          Custom pages (not tied to a model)
│   ├── MobileUsers.php             Users-by-game pages
│   ├── BikeElectronicsUsers.php
│   ├── SUVUsers.php
│   ├── MuscleCarUsers.php
│   ├── SuperCashPrizeUsers.php
│   └── Profile.php
├── Resources/
│   ├── DrawResource.php            Each resource has its own .php + Pages/ dir
│   ├── DrawResource/Pages/{List,Create,Edit,View}Draw.php
│   ├── GameResource.php
│   ├── GameResource/Pages/...
│   ├── ScanResource.php
